idth=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-tCT0gPlQ\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c9c0ffe4-wt4WMjIV\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-iZLit1lV\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-9hedP4UM\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-GJnIRJTN\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Xy9jDN1I\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-HytZWpIK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oeiRoDil\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-F0GgAP2m\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uh8EACD7\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-z8Li5g0k\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-t2AdQI5a\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QNjaiPDU\">advertiser_id<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-ZvVzbmPb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QVc4Tk2n\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-ioU5WctK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-o66q0ZN2\">客户id</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-4t3hY4FA\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-S9aLuxG9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7Dw2HqnT\">aweme_id</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-2KGF86BB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2zZSvcaj\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-qRjFHdc7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-R4d1Cy84\">为绑定的抖音号添加屏蔽词, 只允许传入1个，通过【获取绑定的抖音号】 接口获取，当is_apply_to_adv不传或为false时，aweme_id生效</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-2msXQoMs\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-u0wzXYuK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OH1rIyDK\">is_apply_to_adv</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-2pZx2Q8r\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qMMu20ro\">bool</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-emvFcdlB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gLaYwOW9\">是否应用于当前账户，当is_apply_to_adv不传或为false时，aweme_id生效</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-6P1acptm\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-MR8q1Ze8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uwqqbCWl\">terms<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-msxvlT20\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-v8EfO8sI\">string[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-OYjYNHYU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Pautg2r3\">屏蔽词列表，若添加的屏蔽词已存在，不会再次新增，同一个屏蔽词只会在屏蔽词中记录一次，一次最多添加100个，单个屏蔽词长度范围为0-20字</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-daljO1l0\" id=\"link-4\">请求示例</h3><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Ftools%2Fcomment%2Fterms_banned%2Fadd%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20p